I ran into this problem a while back, and found a nice solution.  Get
an external numberpad.  You can find a reasonable USB pad for 15-30
dollars.  If they're charging more, look elsewhere.  Works great for
Nethack, Angband, and other games, even *gasp* work-related stuff like
spreadsheets.  I'm very satisfied, and my roommate at college did the
same thing with his laptop, too.  Try it out, and happy Hacking!  Watch
out for grid bugs, though...

